  "sourceTitle": "Maple Syrup Sauce",
  "sourceText": "Maple Syrup Sauce\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, December 20, 2009 - 12:17am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 cup Maple syrup\n1/2 cup Brown sugar\n1/2 cup Fresh cream, (35 percent)\n1/4 teaspoon Vanilla\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine ingredients and boil until the sauce is reduced by half. Pour over ice cream or warm apple coffee cake.",
